  <item>
    <title>vol.03 成为猫奴，我们是自愿的！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666ee2bbb6a841272924208c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666ee2bbb6a841272924208c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Jun 2024 13:03:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>两位猫奴主播为大家暖心呈现第三期节目内容《成为猫奴，我们是自愿的！》。提起自家小朋友，两位主播会不自觉变成碎碎念的“炫娃一族”，节目中如果出现奇怪“音效”请大家理解，也欢迎大家在评论区分享你与宠物的有趣日常。最后，祝大家收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>节目提要</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 猫咪名字的由来：为啥不叫旺财</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> 小猫咪也有自己的个性：上来！单挑！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="757">12:37</a> 猫咪是我的“劫”：让我和我的猫分开？我不！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1258">20:58</a> 小猫咪迷惑：不是！你怎么又哭了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> 小猫的敏锐度：背着我偷吃？休想！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期歌单</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《旺财歌》戴军</span></p><span></span><p><span>《反叛》陈慧娴</span></p><span></span><p><span>《If Rain》萨吉</span></p><span></span><p><span>《爱要怎么说出口（live版）》陈立农 吉克隽逸</span></p><span></span><p><span>《陪你度过漫长岁月》陈奕迅</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微博 | @艺儒_小盆友 @冬西_Eating</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书 | @艺儒_小盆友</span></p>]]></description>
